# A FILE FROM BEFORE THE STARS EXISTED.
#
# Version 1 of this format had no `stars` key, because Day 19 had not happened. The engine
# reading it is version 2 and does not fail: a key that is absent takes the default the engine
# already had, which for stars is none.
#
# THIS IS THE HALF OF COMPATIBILITY PEOPLE REMEMBER. The other half is in future.scene.

meridian 1

scene legacy
  camera    9.0 3.0 20.0
  look      0.380 0.020 60
  tonemap   aces
  exposure  1.0
  bloom     0.60 1.00
  dust      6000 drift box 30 0.7 1.0
  note      a version 1 file
end
